  "duration_s": 460.590998,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "四岁被通缉八岁去坐牢，十岁爬着回家。三十年后，他让整个西方闭嘴，家人们你敢信吗？一个四岁的孩子被国民党悬赏通缉膝，中国年纪最小的政治犯，八岁被关进大牢，被吊起来打打的不成人形。十岁后出狱，两条腿烂的站都站不起来，硬是沿着铁路爬了十几公里，膝盖磨的血肉模模糊，才爬回养母家的门口。就这么一个孩子，三十年后亲手造出了核潜艇，让那些曾经看不起中国的西方大国一个个都闭上了嘴。他叫彭士路，中国核潜艇第一任总设计师，人们叫他中国核潜艇之父。先说他那个让人揪心的童年吧。一九二五年，彭士路出生，在广东海风他爹叫澎湃，是共产党早期的大人物，领着农民闹革命的那就在三岁那年，他妈被捕入狱，牺牲了四岁那年，他爹在上海被捕入狱，临行行前，高唱着国际歌。三十三岁啊，慷慨赴死。四岁的孩子连死是啥意思？都不懂，就成了敌人眼里的祸根。敌人放出狠话，斩草除根，通缉令贴的到处都是悬赏要这个四岁娃娃的命。你想想四岁啊，和现在的孩子们还在幼儿园里抢玩具呢，彭氏路四岁就已经开始逃命了，是老百姓拿命护的。他海封那边，二十多户穷苦人家东家，塞一口红薯，给他戚家，给他补一件旧衣裳。你那藏几天，我这躲几个月，硬是把烈士的这根独苗护了下来。在那个年代，藏一个革命者的孩子抓住是要掉脑袋的，可没有一个人怕八岁那年，他还是被抓住了，关进了大牢牢里是个啥日子。饭里混着沙子泥和虫子，身上爬满了石子，盖的是发臭的破麻袋。敌人逼他承认自己是澎湃的儿子，他不说，敌人就把养他的姑妈抓来，把人倒吊起来灌辣椒水，逼他开口，那个农村妇女咬碎了牙，半个字儿都没往外吐。后来狱友们护着他他才被放出来。那一年，他十岁，两条腿已经被折磨的走不了路了。他拖着烂腿，顺着铁道爬爬了十几公里，膝盖被磨的全是血，才爬回养母。家家人们，你听听这是个十岁的孩子啊，别人家孩子十岁还在爹妈的怀里撒娇，他才十岁，是拿命顺着铁道爬着回来的。后来他又被抓过，又逃出来，从流浪再到乞讨，后来东躲西藏，以至于整个童年全是踩着刀尖过来。直到一九四零年，周恩来总理派人辗转找到了他。周总理握着他的手，说了一句，孩子终于找到你了。十五岁的彭氏路被送到延安，这才算第一次有了家的感觉。后来有人问他，吃了这么多苦，你恨不恨，他说，我不恨，我这辈子都感激老百姓，是他们给了我第二条生命。家人们，你品品这句话，换个人遭了这些罪，心里得有多大怨气，可他呢不恨他记着的全是恩情。一九五一年，彭石路考上公派留苏的名额，去苏联学化工机械。一九五六年离毕业还有几个月，陈赓大将突然召见他，就问他一句，国家要搞核动力，需要你改行，你愿意吗？他连犹豫都没有，只要祖国需要我，我愿意贡献。请就这一句话，他把自己的名字。从公众视野里抹掉了整整三十年。那时候搞核潜艇，咱们手里有啥没有图纸，没有专家，没有资料，全部的家底就是几张国外报纸上的模糊照片。西方大国嘲笑到，中国人想搞核潜艇再等二十年嘛。可彭时禄带着几百号人，一头扎进四川的深山老林。没有计算机，就靠算盘，计算齿手摇、计算器、三班倒，连轴算油灯。拨到凌晨三点，算盘珠子噼里啪啦响个不停，十几万个。核心数据硬是用人手一遍遍的算出来，草稿纸堆的比人还高，装满三个大铁皮柜，粮食不够吃，挖野菜，啃菜根，没人喊苦。数据算错了，推倒重来，没人抱怨。一九七零年八月三十，核潜艇反应堆首次达到满功率。整个深山都沸腾了，哭的哭喊的喊，有人蹲在地上，眼泪砸进泥里。可没人知道，总设计师彭石路已经连续五天五夜没合眼。消息传来的那一刻，他靠在墙角直接昏睡了过去。同年十二月，中国第一艘核潜艇下水四点六万个零件全部国产，中国成了世界上第五个拥有核潜艇的国家。那些说再等二十年的人，全都闭着嘴。家人们，你频频这反差。四岁被通缉的孤儿，八岁坐牢的小政治犯，十岁爬着回家的苦孩子，最后亲手给新中国筑起了镇海重器。小时候，老百姓用命护住了他，长大后，他用一辈子的命护住了十四亿人的安稳。彭时路常说，我这条命是捡回来的，可这捡回来的命，他一分一毫全交给了国家，觉得彭老了不起的评论区打致敬英雄四个字，点亮小红心，让更多人看见这份骨气，把这条视频命到家庭群讲给孩子听。今天的安稳日子是拿什么换来的？点个收藏，随时翻出来讲，关注我，咱们一起把先辈的故事一代代传下去。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00001",
      "start_ms": 150,
      "end_ms": 2610,
      "text": "四岁被通缉八岁去坐牢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2970,
      "end_ms": 4290,
      "text": "十岁爬着回家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4530,
      "end_ms": 5370,
      "text": "三十年后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00004",
      "start_ms": 5570,
      "end_ms": 7350,
      "text": "他让整个西方闭嘴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00005",
      "start_ms": 7870,
      "end_ms": 9550,
      "text": "家人们你敢信吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00006",
      "start_ms": 10210,
      "end_ms": 14890,
      "text": "一个四岁的孩子被国民党悬赏通缉膝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00007",
      "start_ms": 14890,
      "end_ms": 17030,
      "text": "中国年纪最小的政治犯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00008",
      "start_ms": 17290,
      "end_ms": 19130,
      "text": "八岁被关进大牢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00009",
      "start_ms": 19250,
      "end_ms": 21710,
      "text": "被吊起来打打的不成人形。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00010",
      "start_ms": 22190,
      "end_ms": 23390,
      "text": "十岁后出狱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00011",
      "start_ms": 23690,
      "end_ms": 25710,
      "text": "两条腿烂的站都站不起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00012",
      "start_ms": 26090,
      "end_ms": 28350,
      "text": "硬是沿着铁路爬了十几公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00013",
      "start_ms": 28750,
      "end_ms": 30540,
      "text": "膝盖磨的血肉模模糊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00014",
      "start_ms": 30820,
      "end_ms": 32740,
      "text": "才爬回养母家的门口。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00015",
      "start_ms": 33160,
      "end_ms": 34360,
      "text": "就这么一个孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00016",
      "start_ms": 34420,
      "end_ms": 37660,
      "text": "三十年后亲手造出了核潜艇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00017",
      "start_ms": 38039,
      "end_ms": 43340,
      "text": "让那些曾经看不起中国的西方大国一个个都闭上了嘴。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00018",
      "start_ms": 43880,
      "end_ms": 45000,
      "text": "他叫彭士路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00019",
      "start_ms": 45480,
      "end_ms": 48600,
      "text": "中国核潜艇第一任总设计师，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00020",
      "start_ms": 49340,
      "end_ms": 52620,
      "text": "人们叫他中国核潜艇之父。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00021",
      "start_ms": 53300,
      "end_ms": 55840,
      "text": "先说他那个让人揪心的童年吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00022",
      "start_ms": 56380,
      "end_ms": 57460,
      "text": "一九二五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00023",
      "start_ms": 57880,
      "end_ms": 59140,
      "text": "彭士路出生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00024",
      "start_ms": 59140,
      "end_ms": 62670,
      "text": "在广东海风他爹叫澎湃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00025",
      "start_ms": 62930,
      "end_ms": 65185,
      "text": "是共产党早期的大人物，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00026",
      "start_ms": 65650,
      "end_ms": 69875,
      "text": "领着农民闹革命的那就在三岁那年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00027",
      "start_ms": 70540,
      "end_ms": 71860,
      "text": "他妈被捕入狱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00028",
      "start_ms": 71940,
      "end_ms": 74005,
      "text": "牺牲了四岁那年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00029",
      "start_ms": 74260,
      "end_ms": 76495,
      "text": "他爹在上海被捕入狱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00030",
      "start_ms": 77410,
      "end_ms": 78535,
      "text": "临行行前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00031",
      "start_ms": 79010,
      "end_ms": 80505,
      "text": "高唱着国际歌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00032",
      "start_ms": 81250,
      "end_ms": 82385,
      "text": "三十三岁啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00033",
      "start_ms": 82820,
      "end_ms": 83805,
      "text": "慷慨赴死。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00034",
      "start_ms": 84310,
      "end_ms": 87800,
      "text": "四岁的孩子连死是啥意思？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00035",
      "start_ms": 87800,
      "end_ms": 88225,
      "text": "都不懂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00036",
      "start_ms": 88790,
      "end_ms": 90765,
      "text": "就成了敌人眼里的祸根。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00037",
      "start_ms": 91290,
      "end_ms": 92625,
      "text": "敌人放出狠话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00038",
      "start_ms": 92980,
      "end_ms": 93925,
      "text": "斩草除根，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00039",
      "start_ms": 94490,
      "end_ms": 98805,
      "text": "通缉令贴的到处都是悬赏要这个四岁娃娃的命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00040",
      "start_ms": 99060,
      "end_ms": 100805,
      "text": "你想想四岁啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00041",
      "start_ms": 101030,
      "end_ms": 104745,
      "text": "和现在的孩子们还在幼儿园里抢玩具呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00042",
      "start_ms": 105720,
      "end_ms": 109405,
      "text": "彭氏路四岁就已经开始逃命了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00043",
      "start_ms": 109620,
      "end_ms": 111220,
      "text": "是老百姓拿命护的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00044",
      "start_ms": 111220,
      "end_ms": 113180,
      "text": "他海封那边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00045",
      "start_ms": 113180,
      "end_ms": 115570,
      "text": "二十多户穷苦人家东家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00046",
      "start_ms": 115570,
      "end_ms": 116350,
      "text": "塞一口红薯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00047",
      "start_ms": 116350,
      "end_ms": 117880,
      "text": "给他戚家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00048",
      "start_ms": 117880,
      "end_ms": 119205,
      "text": "给他补一件旧衣裳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00049",
      "start_ms": 120080,
      "end_ms": 121080,
      "text": "你那藏几天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00050",
      "start_ms": 121180,
      "end_ms": 122220,
      "text": "我这躲几个月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00051",
      "start_ms": 122640,
      "end_ms": 126100,
      "text": "硬是把烈士的这根独苗护了下来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00052",
      "start_ms": 126420,
      "end_ms": 127320,
      "text": "在那个年代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00053",
      "start_ms": 127320,
      "end_ms": 130880,
      "text": "藏一个革命者的孩子抓住是要掉脑袋的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00054",
      "start_ms": 131560,
      "end_ms": 133620,
      "text": "可没有一个人怕八岁那年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00055",
      "start_ms": 134040,
      "end_ms": 135505,
      "text": "他还是被抓住了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00056",
      "start_ms": 137350,
      "end_ms": 140150,
      "text": "关进了大牢牢里是个啥日子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00057",
      "start_ms": 140530,
      "end_ms": 143450,
      "text": "饭里混着沙子泥和虫子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00058",
      "start_ms": 143710,
      "end_ms": 145470,
      "text": "身上爬满了石子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00059",
      "start_ms": 145490,
      "end_ms": 147330,
      "text": "盖的是发臭的破麻袋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00060",
      "start_ms": 148170,
      "end_ms": 150970,
      "text": "敌人逼他承认自己是澎湃的儿子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00061",
      "start_ms": 151030,
      "end_ms": 151630,
      "text": "他不说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00062",
      "start_ms": 152390,
      "end_ms": 154490,
      "text": "敌人就把养他的姑妈抓来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00063",
      "start_ms": 154710,
      "end_ms": 158330,
      "text": "把人倒吊起来灌辣椒水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00064",
      "start_ms": 158770,
      "end_ms": 159590,
      "text": "逼他开口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00065",
      "start_ms": 160790,
      "end_ms": 163250,
      "text": "那个农村妇女咬碎了牙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00066",
      "start_ms": 163250,
      "end_ms": 165710,
      "text": "半个字儿都没往外吐。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00067",
      "start_ms": 166550,
      "end_ms": 171240,
      "text": "后来狱友们护着他他才被放出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00068",
      "start_ms": 172160,
      "end_ms": 172720,
      "text": "那一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00069",
      "start_ms": 173760,
      "end_ms": 174640,
      "text": "他十岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00070",
      "start_ms": 174900,
      "end_ms": 178040,
      "text": "两条腿已经被折磨的走不了路了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00071",
      "start_ms": 178380,
      "end_ms": 179480,
      "text": "他拖着烂腿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00072",
      "start_ms": 179720,
      "end_ms": 182305,
      "text": "顺着铁道爬爬了十几公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00073",
      "start_ms": 182610,
      "end_ms": 184570,
      "text": "膝盖被磨的全是血，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00074",
      "start_ms": 184750,
      "end_ms": 186110,
      "text": "才爬回养母。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00075",
      "start_ms": 186110,
      "end_ms": 187445,
      "text": "家家人们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00076",
      "start_ms": 187970,
      "end_ms": 190685,
      "text": "你听听这是个十岁的孩子啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00077",
      "start_ms": 191230,
      "end_ms": 194530,
      "text": "别人家孩子十岁还在爹妈的怀里撒娇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00078",
      "start_ms": 194830,
      "end_ms": 195785,
      "text": "他才十岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00079",
      "start_ms": 196210,
      "end_ms": 199255,
      "text": "是拿命顺着铁道爬着回来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00080",
      "start_ms": 199960,
      "end_ms": 201245,
      "text": "后来他又被抓过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00081",
      "start_ms": 201660,
      "end_ms": 202525,
      "text": "又逃出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00082",
      "start_ms": 203230,
      "end_ms": 205355,
      "text": "从流浪再到乞讨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00083",
      "start_ms": 205730,
      "end_ms": 207485,
      "text": "后来东躲西藏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00084",
      "start_ms": 207970,
      "end_ms": 211695,
      "text": "以至于整个童年全是踩着刀尖过来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00085",
      "start_ms": 213180,
      "end_ms": 214595,
      "text": "直到一九四零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00086",
      "start_ms": 215220,
      "end_ms": 217655,
      "text": "周恩来总理派人辗转找到了他。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00087",
      "start_ms": 218530,
      "end_ms": 219925,
      "text": "周总理握着他的手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00088",
      "start_ms": 220750,
      "end_ms": 221390,
      "text": "说了一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00089",
      "start_ms": 221450,
      "end_ms": 225515,
      "text": "孩子终于找到你了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00090",
      "start_ms": 227040,
      "end_ms": 230415,
      "text": "十五岁的彭氏路被送到延安，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00091",
      "start_ms": 231420,
      "end_ms": 235245,
      "text": "这才算第一次有了家的感觉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00092",
      "start_ms": 236760,
      "end_ms": 237795,
      "text": "后来有人问他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00093",
      "start_ms": 239520,
      "end_ms": 240385,
      "text": "吃了这么多苦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00094",
      "start_ms": 242570,
      "end_ms": 243305,
      "text": "你恨不恨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00095",
      "start_ms": 243690,
      "end_ms": 244105,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00096",
      "start_ms": 244380,
      "end_ms": 244935,
      "text": "我不恨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00097",
      "start_ms": 245460,
      "end_ms": 247315,
      "text": "我这辈子都感激老百姓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00098",
      "start_ms": 247740,
      "end_ms": 249695,
      "text": "是他们给了我第二条生命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00099",
      "start_ms": 250760,
      "end_ms": 251245,
      "text": "家人们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00100",
      "start_ms": 251730,
      "end_ms": 253375,
      "text": "你品品这句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00101",
      "start_ms": 253740,
      "end_ms": 255685,
      "text": "换个人遭了这些罪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00102",
      "start_ms": 256080,
      "end_ms": 257695,
      "text": "心里得有多大怨气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00103",
      "start_ms": 258300,
      "end_ms": 263705,
      "text": "可他呢不恨他记着的全是恩情。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00104",
      "start_ms": 264710,
      "end_ms": 265665,
      "text": "一九五一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00105",
      "start_ms": 266610,
      "end_ms": 269350,
      "text": "彭石路考上公派留苏的名额，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00106",
      "start_ms": 269470,
      "end_ms": 271995,
      "text": "去苏联学化工机械。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00107",
      "start_ms": 272700,
      "end_ms": 275785,
      "text": "一九五六年离毕业还有几个月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00108",
      "start_ms": 276230,
      "end_ms": 278565,
      "text": "陈赓大将突然召见他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00109",
      "start_ms": 278830,
      "end_ms": 279705,
      "text": "就问他一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00110",
      "start_ms": 280320,
      "end_ms": 281965,
      "text": "国家要搞核动力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00111",
      "start_ms": 282280,
      "end_ms": 283315,
      "text": "需要你改行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00112",
      "start_ms": 283950,
      "end_ms": 284705,
      "text": "你愿意吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00113",
      "start_ms": 286060,
      "end_ms": 287270,
      "text": "他连犹豫都没有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00114",
      "start_ms": 288170,
      "end_ms": 290265,
      "text": "只要祖国需要我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00115",
      "start_ms": 290620,
      "end_ms": 291705,
      "text": "我愿意贡献。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00116",
      "start_ms": 291930,
      "end_ms": 294375,
      "text": "请就这一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00117",
      "start_ms": 294960,
      "end_ms": 296295,
      "text": "他把自己的名字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00118",
      "start_ms": 297330,
      "end_ms": 301030,
      "text": "从公众视野里抹掉了整整三十年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00119",
      "start_ms": 301550,
      "end_ms": 302770,
      "text": "那时候搞核潜艇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00120",
      "start_ms": 302950,
      "end_ms": 305170,
      "text": "咱们手里有啥没有图纸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00121",
      "start_ms": 305310,
      "end_ms": 306050,
      "text": "没有专家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00122",
      "start_ms": 306210,
      "end_ms": 306950,
      "text": "没有资料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00123",
      "start_ms": 307070,
      "end_ms": 312030,
      "text": "全部的家底就是几张国外报纸上的模糊照片。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00124",
      "start_ms": 312650,
      "end_ms": 314130,
      "text": "西方大国嘲笑到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00125",
      "start_ms": 314510,
      "end_ms": 317790,
      "text": "中国人想搞核潜艇再等二十年嘛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00126",
      "start_ms": 318170,
      "end_ms": 320110,
      "text": "可彭时禄带着几百号人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00127",
      "start_ms": 320750,
      "end_ms": 323410,
      "text": "一头扎进四川的深山老林。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00128",
      "start_ms": 323870,
      "end_ms": 324910,
      "text": "没有计算机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00129",
      "start_ms": 325250,
      "end_ms": 326170,
      "text": "就靠算盘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00130",
      "start_ms": 326530,
      "end_ms": 330140,
      "text": "计算齿手摇、计算器、三班倒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00131",
      "start_ms": 330420,
      "end_ms": 332240,
      "text": "连轴算油灯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00132",
      "start_ms": 332400,
      "end_ms": 333680,
      "text": "拨到凌晨三点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00133",
      "start_ms": 334000,
      "end_ms": 336100,
      "text": "算盘珠子噼里啪啦响个不停，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00134",
      "start_ms": 336580,
      "end_ms": 337480,
      "text": "十几万个。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00135",
      "start_ms": 337480,
      "end_ms": 341880,
      "text": "核心数据硬是用人手一遍遍的算出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00136",
      "start_ms": 342080,
      "end_ms": 344080,
      "text": "草稿纸堆的比人还高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00137",
      "start_ms": 344320,
      "end_ms": 346180,
      "text": "装满三个大铁皮柜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00138",
      "start_ms": 346640,
      "end_ms": 347660,
      "text": "粮食不够吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00139",
      "start_ms": 348100,
      "end_ms": 348740,
      "text": "挖野菜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00140",
      "start_ms": 348940,
      "end_ms": 349700,
      "text": "啃菜根，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00141",
      "start_ms": 349940,
      "end_ms": 350840,
      "text": "没人喊苦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00142",
      "start_ms": 351340,
      "end_ms": 352580,
      "text": "数据算错了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00143",
      "start_ms": 352740,
      "end_ms": 353780,
      "text": "推倒重来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00144",
      "start_ms": 353980,
      "end_ms": 355545,
      "text": "没人抱怨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00145",
      "start_ms": 356580,
      "end_ms": 358535,
      "text": "一九七零年八月三十，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00146",
      "start_ms": 359090,
      "end_ms": 362105,
      "text": "核潜艇反应堆首次达到满功率。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00147",
      "start_ms": 362590,
      "end_ms": 364415,
      "text": "整个深山都沸腾了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00148",
      "start_ms": 364860,
      "end_ms": 366295,
      "text": "哭的哭喊的喊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00149",
      "start_ms": 366590,
      "end_ms": 367685,
      "text": "有人蹲在地上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00150",
      "start_ms": 368010,
      "end_ms": 369605,
      "text": "眼泪砸进泥里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00151",
      "start_ms": 370230,
      "end_ms": 371175,
      "text": "可没人知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00152",
      "start_ms": 371520,
      "end_ms": 375925,
      "text": "总设计师彭石路已经连续五天五夜没合眼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00153",
      "start_ms": 376910,
      "end_ms": 378565,
      "text": "消息传来的那一刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00154",
      "start_ms": 378960,
      "end_ms": 382345,
      "text": "他靠在墙角直接昏睡了过去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00155",
      "start_ms": 383290,
      "end_ms": 384535,
      "text": "同年十二月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00156",
      "start_ms": 385310,
      "end_ms": 391435,
      "text": "中国第一艘核潜艇下水四点六万个零件全部国产，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00157",
      "start_ms": 392560,
      "end_ms": 397695,
      "text": "中国成了世界上第五个拥有核潜艇的国家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00158",
      "start_ms": 398190,
      "end_ms": 399965,
      "text": "那些说再等二十年的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00159",
      "start_ms": 400220,
      "end_ms": 401005,
      "text": "全都闭着嘴。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00160",
      "start_ms": 401780,
      "end_ms": 402265,
      "text": "家人们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00161",
      "start_ms": 402630,
      "end_ms": 404135,
      "text": "你频频这反差。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00162",
      "start_ms": 404530,
      "end_ms": 406385,
      "text": "四岁被通缉的孤儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00163",
      "start_ms": 406780,
      "end_ms": 408615,
      "text": "八岁坐牢的小政治犯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00164",
      "start_ms": 409060,
      "end_ms": 411295,
      "text": "十岁爬着回家的苦孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00165",
      "start_ms": 411850,
      "end_ms": 416135,
      "text": "最后亲手给新中国筑起了镇海重器。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00166",
      "start_ms": 417110,
      "end_ms": 417790,
      "text": "小时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00167",
      "start_ms": 418150,
      "end_ms": 420410,
      "text": "老百姓用命护住了他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00168",
      "start_ms": 420470,
      "end_ms": 421130,
      "text": "长大后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00169",
      "start_ms": 421410,
      "end_ms": 425490,
      "text": "他用一辈子的命护住了十四亿人的安稳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00170",
      "start_ms": 425950,
      "end_ms": 427050,
      "text": "彭时路常说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00171",
      "start_ms": 427410,
      "end_ms": 429690,
      "text": "我这条命是捡回来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00172",
      "start_ms": 430050,
      "end_ms": 431430,
      "text": "可这捡回来的命，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00173",
      "start_ms": 431690,
      "end_ms": 434830,
      "text": "他一分一毫全交给了国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00174",
      "start_ms": 435330,
      "end_ms": 440270,
      "text": "觉得彭老了不起的评论区打致敬英雄四个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00175",
      "start_ms": 440470,
      "end_ms": 441590,
      "text": "点亮小红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00176",
      "start_ms": 441950,
      "end_ms": 444530,
      "text": "让更多人看见这份骨气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00177",
      "start_ms": 445190,
      "end_ms": 449220,
      "text": "把这条视频命到家庭群讲给孩子听。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00178",
      "start_ms": 449700,
      "end_ms": 452800,
      "text": "今天的安稳日子是拿什么换来的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00179",
      "start_ms": 453060,
      "end_ms": 453940,
      "text": "点个收藏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00180",
      "start_ms": 454240,
      "end_ms": 455540,
      "text": "随时翻出来讲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00181",
      "start_ms": 455680,
      "end_ms": 456260,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c44a594675438138_s00182",
      "start_ms": 456500,
      "end_ms": 460465,
      "text": "咱们一起把先辈的故事一代代传下去。"
    }
  ],
